{
  "name": "284. MiniMax provider (minimax provider)",
  "description": "MiniMax is reached through its OpenAI-compatible chat API, its /v1/image_generation API its /v2/video_generation task API, /v1/t2a_v2 for speech and /v1/speech_to_text for transcription. Bifrost sends reasoning_split true on chat so thinking comes back in reasoning_content instead of <think> tags inside the answer, maps reasoning_effort none to thinking disabled (dropped on M3.1, which always thinks), and turns a non-zero base_resp.status_code on a 200 into an error. Chat responses carry MiniMax's top-level input_sensitive, output_sensitive, input_sensitive_type and output_sensitive_type flags unchanged (TXE-6595). /v1/responses goes to MiniMax's native /v1/responses, and /anthropic/v1/messages is forwarded byte-for-byte to MiniMax's /anthropic/v1/messages; live bytes cannot show which path served them, so the routing is pinned by the Go recording-server tests in core/providers/minimax and transports/bifrost-http/integrations. Video generation is billed per output second, so it is covered by Go tests and not by a live case here. Speech audio comes back hex-encoded and Bifrost decodes it; an unknown voice is a 200 with base_resp 2054 that Bifrost turns into a 400.",
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "/v1/chat/completions - thinking arrives as reasoning, not <think> tags - minimax/MiniMax-M3",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('answer is clean and served by minimax', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'failed: ' + pm.response.text()).to.eql(200);",
              "  var j = pm.response.json();",
              "  var msg = j.choices[0].message;",
              "  pm.expect(msg.content, 'empty content: ' + pm.response.text()).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "  pm.expect(msg.content, 'reasoning leaked into content as <think> tags').to.not.include('<think>');",
              "  pm.expect(msg.content).to.include('391');",
              "  pm.expect(j.extra_fields.provider).to.eql('minimax');",
              "  pm.expect(j.usage.total_tokens, 'usage missing').to.be.above(0);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"minimax/MiniMax-M3\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"What is 17 * 23? Answer with just the number.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "v1",
            "chat",
            "completions"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
